    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>A former dockworker and union organizer, Jake was Embraced in 1922 and led New Orleans' @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.ZFYurbvAHfaRguYI]{Brujah} until Dutch's arrival forced him to yield. Rather than fight openly, Jake made himself indispensable as Dutch's lieutenant, quietly sabotaging his leader's ambitions whenever he judged them contrary to @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.ZFYurbvAHfaRguYI]{Brujah} interests &mdash; including discrediting Dutch's 1955 bid for the princedom. Despite his private disagreements, Jake shares Dutch's belief that a Brujah, not a @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.OpCOs3PLjmtl0QVu]{Ventrue}, should someday rule New Orleans.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Curt and unfriendly to strangers, but passionately vocal about clan matters when Dutch isn't around to hear it.</p><p><strong>Disciplines (as printed, dot-rating, converted to owned Discipline Items on this Actor at Storyteller discretion):</strong> Auspex 2, Celerity 2, Dominate 1, Potence 3, Presence 3.</p>",
    "notes": "Sire: Martine. Haven: An office at the end of Esplanade Avenue near the river. Secrets rating: B.",
